cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use INDELVAR, please cite it as below."
title: "INDELVAR: structure-based pathogenicity prediction for in-frame indels"
abstract: >-
  INDELVAR predicts pathogenicity for in-frame insertions and deletions of 1 to
  10 amino acids in MANE Select coding sequence, and maps the score to
  calibrated ACMG/AMP computational evidence strength.
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Ji
    given-names: Eunhui
keywords:
  - genomics
  - variant interpretation
  - in-frame indel
  - ACMG
  - MANE
repository-code: "https://github.com/eunhui-ji/INDELVAR"
